--
-- Hand-maintained fixtures for the minutes page (/minutes/house/2026/01/26/).
--
-- The House floor session of January 26, 2026 (files.id 15141), taken from production: the
-- clerk's minutes, the video index (bill and legislator chyrons), the captions, and minimal rows
-- for the bills that the index references.
--
-- The video is the original sliq.net recording. (In production, this file's archive.org copy is
-- the wrong recording -- a House Election Administration Subcommittee meeting.)
--
-- The captions in production are timed from the gavel, not from the start of the recording, so
-- they run 701.2 seconds early (measured by matching them against Whisper word timings of the
-- audio). The transcript rows here have been moved later by that amount, so that they line up.
--
-- Legislator video_index.linked_id values are people.id values, as rs-video-processor writes them.
--
-- Rows use INSERT IGNORE so that existing local rows are kept.
--

